#ASSERT `the number of penalty units that a penalty of D dollars is taken to be` 250 EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `the number of penalty units that a penalty of D dollars is taken to be` 299.99 EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `the number of penalty units that a penalty of D dollars is taken to be` 300 EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `the number of penalty units that a penalty of D dollars is taken to be` 330 EQUALS 4
#ASSERT `the number of penalty units that a penalty of D dollars is taken to be` 1000 EQUALS 10
#ASSERT `the number of penalty units that a penalty of D dollars is taken to be` 1001 EQUALS 11

§§ `Maximum pecuniary penalties (s 4B)`

#ASSERT `the number of penalty units for each month of the maximum term, s 4B(2)` EQUALS 5
#ASSERT `the number of penalty units calculated using the formula` (Months 12) EQUALS JUST 60
#ASSERT `the number of penalty units calculated using the formula` (Months 1) EQUALS JUST 5
#ASSERT `the number of penalty units calculated using the formula` (Months 6) EQUALS JUST 30
#ASSERT `the number of penalty units calculated using the formula` (Months 13) EQUALS JUST 65
#ASSERT `the number of penalty units calculated using the formula` (Years 1) EQUALS JUST 60
#ASSERT `the number of penalty units calculated using the formula` (Years 2) EQUALS JUST 120
#ASSERT `the number of penalty units calculated using the formula` (Years 10) EQUALS JUST 600
#ASSERT `the number of penalty units calculated using the formula` ForLife EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the number of penalty units calculated using the formula` NoImprisonment EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the number of penalty units for an offence punishable by imprisonment for life` EQUALS 2000
#ASSERT `the multiple of the natural person's maximum for a body corporate` EQUALS 5
#ASSERT `the amount equal to 5 times the natural person's maximum` 60 EQUALS 300
#ASSERT `the amount equal to 5 times the natural person's maximum` 1 EQUALS 5
#ASSERT `the amount equal to 5 times the natural person's maximum` 2000 EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT `the amount equal to 5 times the natural person's maximum` 0 EQUALS 0

§§ `Summary dealing: the stated limits (ss 4J, 4JA)`

#ASSERT `s 4J(3)(a) the most months of imprisonment a court of summary jurisdiction may impose` EQUALS 12
#ASSERT `s 4J(3)(a) the most penalty units of fine a court of summary jurisdiction may impose` EQUALS 60
#ASSERT `s 4J(3)(b) the most months of imprisonment a court of summary jurisdiction may impose` EQUALS 24
#ASSERT `s 4J(3)(b) the most penalty units of fine a court of summary jurisdiction may impose` EQUALS 120
#ASSERT `the value of property, in dollars, that an indictable offence may not exceed for s 4J(4)` EQUALS 5000
#ASSERT `s 4J(5) the most months of imprisonment a court of summary jurisdiction may impose` EQUALS 12
#ASSERT `s 4J(5) the most penalty units of fine a court of summary jurisdiction may impose` EQUALS 60
#ASSERT `s 4JA(1)(b) the most penalty units for an individual` EQUALS 600
#ASSERT `s 4JA(1)(b) the most penalty units for a body corporate` EQUALS 3000
#ASSERT `s 4JA(2)(a) the most penalty units the court may impose on an individual` EQUALS 60
#ASSERT `s 4JA(2)(a) the most penalty units the court may impose on a body corporate` EQUALS 300
#ASSERT `s 4JA(2)(a) the most penalty units on indictment for an individual` EQUALS 300
#ASSERT `s 4JA(2)(a) the most penalty units on indictment for a body corporate` EQUALS 1500
#ASSERT `s 4JA(2)(b) the most penalty units the court may impose on an individual` EQUALS 120
#ASSERT `s 4JA(2)(b) the most penalty units the court may impose on a body corporate` EQUALS 600
#ASSERT `s 4JA(2)(b) the most penalty units on indictment for an individual` EQUALS 600
#ASSERT `s 4JA(2)(b) the most penalty units on indictment for a body corporate` EQUALS 3000

